      "id": "t17_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -560,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Perlin noise\n\nUnlike random/uniform (jumpy), Perlin noise is smooth — neighbouring inputs give neighbouring outputs. Perfect for organic motion.\n\nFor each cell, sample noise at (cellX, time). Use the result to nudge y AND shift hue.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
